<title>USA: ASB Financial Corp Q2 shr rises.</title>
<headline>ASB Financial Corp Q2 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>PORTSMOUTH, Ohio 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended December 31</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.19		    $0.17</p>
<p> Net			    313			277</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.08		    $0.36</p>
<p> Net			    137			575</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - First six months of 1996 includes a one-time assessment of $551,000 related to the recapitalization of the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>Total assets at December 31, 1996, were $111.8 million versus $112.9 million at December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
